q is a member of att.global, att.ascribed.directed, att.cmc and att.typed;
interp of att.global, att.cmc and att.interpLike. att.global's attributes are
its own and those of the classes that are members of it: analytic, change,
facs, linking, rendition, responsibility, source. Every class an element's
attributes come from is pinned, so the reader resolves them as the Guidelines
do. model.* classes say where an element may appear, not what it carries, and
are not pinned. The two elements' pages, as published:

